RecipeExecutor
├── deterministic gas snapshots
│   ├── meter packed arithmetic, repeated reads and approval resets across multiple steps
│   ├── measure wrong-caller and stale-commitment rejection
│   ├── measure successful checks and bindings and rollback before or after writes
│   ├── measure zero-gate runtime skipping, bound multi-action execution and leaf rejection
│   └── measure approval reset failure and empty or trailing token return data
├── configuration
│   ├── deploy through ImmutableFactory with explicit curator and adapter
│   ├── reject configuration by non-owner and execution by non-caller
│   ├── commit the complete recipe hash and emit reconstructable configuration
│   ├── write only two configuration slots regardless of query and instruction count
│   ├── reject unconfigured or stale recipes and wrong callers before queries
│   └── block reentry and configuration during callbacks
├── action evaluation
│   ├── evaluate a single ordered sequence of reads, arithmetic, assertions and calls
│   ├── index results by instruction and reject references to non-value instructions
│   ├── bind multiple literal/input/prior-result values into bounded, ordered calldata words
│   ├── reject missing inputs, unpopulated result references and incomplete words
│   ├── preserve full-width literals, checked arithmetic, saturating subtraction, Min and Max
│   ├── multiply before floor division and reject product overflow even when the quotient fits
│   ├── reuse full-width Min and Max results in bindings and later arithmetic, including equal and inverted extremes
│   ├── reject overflowing binding offsets before any write
│   ├── reuse shared queries with captured epoch references and fresh calldata buffers
│   ├── decode native query tuples and reject truncated headers or invalid dynamic offsets
│   ├── measure unsigned increases/decreases and revert opposite-direction changes
│   ├── consume runtime for skipped zero-guard managed actions and keep subsequent checks
│   └── roll back all writes if any before/after comparison fails
├── adapter permissions and account actions
│   ├── validate exact ordered leaves after all bindings, independently of outer ABI layout
│   ├── preserve nested ABI headers while supporting unaligned inner calldata words
│   ├── reject native value, changed leaves, stale roots and revoked roles
│   ├── call only curator-committed templates, including empty and short fallback calldata
│   ├── execute approved calls from the paired account and trusted local policy calls from executor
│   └── approve from the paired account, reset nonzero allowance, accept empty/trailing true returns and reject false/malformed returns
│       ├── decode native mask/proof tuples without an outer struct wrapper
│       ├── resolve input and prior-result amounts before allowance reset
│       ├── reject truncated committed payloads, invalid source enums and noncanonical addresses
│       ├── preserve action authorization with trailing committed payload bytes
│       ├── roll back successful reset and earlier calls when the replacement approval fails
│       └── require the committed approval leaf to authorize the zero reset amount
├── lending recipe
│   ├── supply LBTC, guarded USDC borrowing, immediate RWA acquisition
│   ├── preserve preexisting USDC and clear allowances
│   └── reject altered effects, insufficient output, unsafe health and repeated excess debt
└── liquidity recipe
    ├── release only unreserved controller funds before ordered sources when configured
    ├── source in order, authenticate signed swap and check consumption
    ├── observe issuer-native receipts at the pre-action-bound epoch
    ├── require redemption receipts and cap outstanding exposure
    └── reject bypass of configured caller, actions or policy
